Package: ooenv
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign POSIX environment controller, secret sanitizer, and execution simulator in pure openOODA.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 secret token redaction, dangerous variable auditing, systemd unit override
 generation, and streaming Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
